## Implementation and commits

- `1e928372 fix(remoting): match Java throwable identity equality` changes
  `ErrorSource` equality from display-chain comparison to shared wrapped-error
  identity. Its regression proves clones compare equal and distinct causes
  with the same text compare unequal. The request-classification test now
  checks mapped variant/address/cause text without comparing fresh cause
  identities.
- `dcd00304 docs(compatibility): record remoting error identity parity`
  updates the Remoting inventory, Known Differences, release checklist, and a
  focused run record.
- `cdf5efcb docs(compatibility): record current error identity gates` records
  the refreshed server-free gates and benchmark sample.
- `e83a9e85 docs(compatibility): refresh cross inventory review` removes an
  obsolete Phase 0 Known Differences statement and records the remaining
  GO_AWAY interleaving boundary.
- This session also updates the top-level README's P18-V02 date and records
  the P18-V03 review. Its changes are included in the final documentation
  commit for this session.

