  the full default workspace suite passed with
  `CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/rocketmq-phase18-target`. The all-feature run used
  the same target and passed.
- Matrix and runtime crosswalks were updated. Broad P18-V01 source/API/input/
  flow/reverse-export reconciliation remains PARTIAL. Native Windows runtime
  and current-revision remote Ubuntu CI remain unverified; no push or remote
  CI was run. The four pre-existing Phase 19 worktree paths remain unstaged
